<title>USA: Denver, Colo. won by A.G. Edwards &amp; Sons.</title>
<headline>Denver, Colo. won by A.G. Edwards &amp; Sons.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.G. Edwards &amp; Sons said it won $39.955 million of Denver (City and County), Colo., certificates of participation, with a true interest cost of 5.005 percent.</p>
</text>
